Description: top-down retro football game
 Kaptan Mecit is a fast retro football game with four camera views:
 classic pixel-art top-down, dynamic, TV-style tele and a 3D stadium.
 Play 11-a-side matches against the computer, or run a 38-week league
 career with one of 120 fictional clubs in six leagues. The game works
 fully offline, has no ads and collects no data. The interface is in
 Turkish.
